WEBVTT

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:05.807
Open Operations, Call insights.

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:10.426
A report page has a filter panel on top and the results below.

00:00:10.426 --> 00:00:13.754
Each report shows only the filters it uses.

00:00:14.212 --> 00:00:16.334
Date range starts on Today.

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:17.941
Click it to choose.

00:00:17.941 --> 00:00:21.221
Relative days run from Today to Last 90 Days.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.757
Calendar periods run from This Week to Last Year.

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:28.872
Rolling months cover the last three, six or twelve months.

00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:35.545
Custom Range takes a start and an end date and time, in the site's time zone.

00:00:35.545 --> 00:00:39.619
On or before and On or after leave one side open.

00:00:40.163 --> 00:00:42.831
Choose Last 7 Days and click Show.

00:00:42.831 --> 00:00:48.635
The cards fill in with total, inbound and outbound calls, answered, abandoned and

00:00:48.635 --> 00:00:51.703
failed, then the daily trend below them.

